2 CONC tess of Fondi, Giovanna from L'Aquila, while, on October 3 of that year, he ordered Cardinal Gerardo Bianchi, bishop of Sabina, to investigate the previous marriages of the Countess of Sovana, who she was soon declared a bigama. W
