2 CONT iv)       GIOVANNA de Sabran (-after 1379).  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (Naples [1352/55]) NICCOLÒ Orsini Conte di Nola, son of ROBERTO Orsini & his wife Suevia de Baux (27 Aug 1331-after 14 Feb 1399). 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Jeanne de Sabran1,2,3
2 CONT *'''F, #18159, d. circa 1378
2 CONT *Father	Guillaume de Sabran, 3rd Count d'Ariano2,4,3
2 CONT *Mother	Francisca di Celano2,4,3 d. bt 22 Feb 1374 - 7 Apr 1379
2 CONT *'''     Jeanne de Sabran married Sir Nicholo Orsini, Count de Nola & Soleto, Senator of Rome, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples''', son of Roberto Orsini, 2nd Count di Nola
2 CONC , Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, Monforte, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples and Sueva des Baux, '''before 5 January 1363 at Naples, Italy; They had 3 sons''' (Robert, Count of Pitigliano; Sir Raimondo, P
2 CONC rince of Tarento, Duke of Andria, Count of Soleto; & Gentile) '''and 2 daughters''' (Sueva, wife of François des Baux, Duke de Andria, Count of Montescaglioso & Squillace; & Beatrice, wife of Luigi Antonio della Ratta, Count of Ca
2 CONC serta).2,3 '''Jeanne de Sabran died circa 1378.
2 CONT *'''Family     Sir Nicholo Orsini, Count de Nola & Soleto, Senator of Rome, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples''' b. 27 Aug 1331
2 CONT *'''Children	
2 CONT **Sueva Orsini+2,4,3 d. a 23 Apr 1422
2 CONT **Roberto Orsini, 4th Count di Nola, Signore di Vicovaro, Roccagiovine, Cantalupo, Nettuno, Bardella, Forino, Boiano, Saturnia, Avella, Montemerano, Atripalda, & Cicala+5,6 b. c 1359, d. 1399
2 CONT **Raimondo Orsini, Prince of Taranto, Duke d'Andria, Comte di Soleto+7 b. c 1365, d. 17 Jan 1406
2 CONT **Caterina Orsini+8 b. c 1370
2 CONT *Citations
