2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p605.htm#i18159 ______________
2 CONT *'''Jeanne de Sabran1
2 CONT *'''F, #3514, b. 1330, d. 1380
2 CONT *Last Edited=26 Jun 2013
2 CONT *'''     Jeanne de Sabran was born in 1330.1 She was the daughter''' of William de Sabran, Count of Ariano. '''She married Nicolo Orsini, Conte di Nola''', son of Roberto Orsini, Conte di Nola Signore di Vicovaro and Sveva del Bal
2 CONC zo, Contessa di Soleto, '''in 1350 at Naples, Italy.1 She and Nicolo Orsini, Conte di Nola were divorced in 1355.1 She died in 1380.1
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S3268] Hans Harmsen, "re: Chester Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 21 August 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Chester Family."
