2 CONT *'''F, #16484, d. after 23 April 1422
2 CONT *Father	Sir Nicholo Orsini, Count de Nola & Soleto, Senator of Rome, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples2,4,5,8,7 b. 27 Aug 1331
