2 CONT *'''     Sueva Orsini married François de Baux, 1st Duke d'Andria, 2nd Comte di Montescaglioso & Squillace''', son of Bertrand II de Baux, Duke d'Andria, Seigneur de Berre, Count of Montescagioso & Squillace, Justiciar of Sicily, 
2 CONC Senator of Rome and Marguerite d' Aulnay, '''in 1381; They had 2 sons''' (Guglielmo, Duke of Andria; & Bianchino) '''and 1 daughter''' (Marguerite, wife of Sir Pierre de Luxembourg, Comte de St. Pol, Conversano, & Brienne).2,3,5,6
2 CONC ,7 '''Sueva Orsini died after 23 April 1422.9
