1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * The soldier Guglielmo Cardona received a royal letter from Queen Eleonora of Aragon. He was summoned on 5.1.1361 to provide military service.
2 CONT *  He died earlier than 17.6.1363, when the widow Francesca, also on behalf of her children Federico and Giacomo Cardona, asked and obtained from King Frederick IV the concession of the fief Borgetto (to be identified with the feu
2 CONC d Burgio, in VN in the Butera estate) after the death of Avinante Lopes de Caparosa without heirs, due to the fact that Guglielmo Cardona had loaned 200 onze to Giacobino, the father of Avinante. 
2 CONT * On 17.6.1363 the sovereign invested in the Borgetto fiefdom Federico Cardona as the firstborn.
