2 CONT **Louis I de Luxembourg, Count of St. Pol, Brienne, Conversano, Ligny, & d'Enghien, Governor of Champagne+4,7 b. 1418, d. 19 Dec 1475
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S4721] Unknown author, Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Paget, Vol. II, p. 355; The Ancestry of Dorothea Poyntz, by Ronny O. Bodine, p. 28.
