2 CONC yricard.  Seigneur de Berre.  Bertrand de Baux Seigneur de Berre swore allegiance to Pierre Archbishop of Arles for the château de Trinquetaille and other properties by charter dated 1189[539].  The primary source which confirms h
2 CONC is date of death has not been identified.  
2 CONT
