2 CONC  property to Farfa for the souls of "domini Crescentii genitoris mei et domnæ Theodoræ genitricis meæ suprascriptæ Rogatæ et…Johannis patricii Romanorum germani mei et senioris nostri"[783].  Ioannes [I] Crescentius & his wife had
