2 CONC urg, Count of St. Pol, Conversano, & Brienne, Seigneur d'Enghien died on 31 August 1433 at Rambures, Somme, Picardie, France; Buried at the Abbey of Cercamp, Artois, France. Died of the Plague.34,4,5,19,29
