1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Isabelle de Luxembourg1,2
2 CONT *'''F, #48430, d. 1472
2 CONT *Father	Sir Pierre of Luxembourg, Count of St. Pol, Conversano, & Brienne, Seigneur d'Enghien2 b. 1390, d. 31 Aug 1433
2 CONT *Mother	Marguerite de Baux3,2 b. 1394, d. 15 Nov 1469
2 CONT *'''     Isabelle de Luxembourg married Charles d' Anjou, Duke du Maine, Comte de Guise & Gien''', son of Louis II, King of Naples, Sicily, & Jerusalem, Duke of Anjou and Jolanta of Aragon, '''on 9 January 1443.4,2 Isabelle de Lux
2 CONC embourg died in 1472.5,2
2 CONT *'''Family     Charles d' Anjou, Duke du Maine, Comte de Guise & Gien''' b. 14 Oct 1414, d. 10 Apr 1472
2 CONT *'''Child	
2 CONT **Louise d' Anjou+6 b. c 1445, d. 1477
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VI, Tafel 28; Vol. II, Tafel 26.
2 CONT *[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. I/2, Tafel 231.
2 CONT *[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VI, Tafel 28.
2 CONT *[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. II, Tafel 26; Vol. XI, Tafel 28.
2 CONT *[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. II, Tafel 26; Vol. VI, Tafel 28.
