2 CONT '''Gianfrancesco Gonzaga, Marchese di Mantova''' (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #164141, b. 1395, d. 1444
2 CONT >Last Edited=14 Mar 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Gianfrancesco Gonzaga, Marchese di Mantova was born in 1395. He was the son of Francesco I Gonzaga. (1) He married Paola Malatesta in 1409. (2) He died in 1444. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Gianfrancesco Gonzaga, Marchese di Mantova gained the title of Marchese di Mantova in 1407. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Gianfrancesco Gonzaga, Marchese di Mantova and Paola Malatesta
2 CONT *1.Ludovico II Gonzaga, Marchese di Mantova+ (1) b. 1412, d. 1478
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Citations''' 1.[S38] John Morby, Dynasties of the World: a chronological and genealogical handbook (Oxford, Oxfordshire, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1989), page 107. Hereinafter cited as Dynasties of the World. 2.[S3409] Car
2 CONC oline Maubois, "re: Penancoet Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 2 December 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Penancoet Family."
