2 CONC  is a village not far from Aquino, but there could be a mix-up with Teate (nowdays Chieti) a town of Abruzzi of which members of Caracciolo family were counts, bishops or generally were entitled. 
2 CONT *     Memorie Istoriche della Città di S. Agata dei Goti ( printed in Naples by M Avallone 1841) pag. 54 and 119  
