2 CONT '''     A contract for the marriage of Guillaume de Blois, Vicomte de Limoges, Seigneur d'Avesnes & Nouvion-en-Thierache and Isabeau (Isabelle) de la Tour was signed on 16 May 1450.2 Guillaume de Blois, Vicomte de Limoges, Seigneu
2 CONC r d'Avesnes & Nouvion-en-Thierache left a will on 24 August 1454.2 He died on 30 September 1454'''.2
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Isabeau (Isabelle) de la Tour''' d. 8 Sep 1488
2 CONT '''Child'''	
