2 CONC 72) and Costanzo I. (1447-1483); his second marriage to Sveva of Montefeltro (1432-1478) was annulled in 1457; besides that he had two illegitimate daughters: Ginevra (1440-1507) and Antonia (1445-1500) 8.his daughter Orsola (1411
2 CONC -1460), nun in a convent of the Poor Clares from his relationship with Tamira di Cagli:
2 CONT
