2 CONC  filius Ioseph et Rogata filia Crescentii comitis uxor eius" donated "res suis territorii Sabinensis, Postmontem ad Sanctam Mariam in Canneto" to Farfa[597].  "Octavianum filium…Ioseph et…Rogatam filiam…Crescentii comitis uxoremqu
2 CONC e suprascripti Octaviani" donated property to Farfa by charter dated Dec 1005[598].  "Domnum Octavianum…filium…Joseph…et domnam Rogatam…iugalem filiam…Crescentii bone memorie" donated property to Farfa, for the souls of "domini Cr
2 CONC escentii genitoris mei et domnæ Theodoræ genitricis meæ suprascriptæ Rogatæ et…Johannis patricii Romanorum germani mei et senioris nostri", by charter dated Oct 1006[599].  "Octavianus filius…Joseph" is named in a charter dated Ap
2 CONC r 1024[600]. 
