2 CONT *'''John WOODVILLE (Sir Knight)
2 CONT *'''Born: AFT 1444
2 CONT *'''Died: 12 Aug 1469, Kenilworht, Northamptonshire, England
2 CONT *'''Notes: beheaded by Warwick, along with his father, at Coventry. Famed for having made the "Diabolical Marriage" to the Duchess of Norfolk to advance the family of his sister Elizabeth. John was 20 at his marriage; Catherine 80
2 CONC .
2 CONT *Father: Richard WOODVILLE (1° E. Rivers)
