2 CONT ***''''''   11. CHARLES CHURCHILL, who married MARGARET, only daughter and heiress of Sir William Widville, who brought him considerable estate. They had a son, 
2 CONT ****   12. THOMAS CHURCHILL, who married GRACE, daughter of Thomas Tylle, of Tylle House in Cornwall, and by her had a son, 
2 CONT *___________________________
2 CONT *9-William Churchill, who assumed that form of the name, resided at Rockbear in Devonshire. 
2 CONT **10-Giles Churchill. 
