2 CONT Geoffrey I of Provence
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Geoffrey was succeeded by his son Bertrand. One daughter became the first wife of Raymond IV of Toulouse, another, Stephanie, married William II of Besalú and the third was Gerberga, married Gilbert I of Gévaudan.
2 CONT
