1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/provvaldi.htm#BertrandAvellinodied1304
2 CONT
2 CONT iii)        '''MARQUISE de Baux''' (-before 12 Oct 1270).  The marriage contract between “Barralus dominus Baucli...Marquisiam filiam” and “domini comitis Ruthenensis...Henricum filium” is dated 8 Sep 1256[515].  A manuscript of R
2 CONC odez convent records the marriage "1259 XV Kal Dec" of "Henricus comes Ruthenensis filius Hugonis" and "domina Marquesia de Baus"[516].  A charter dated 9 Jun 1279 records the execution of the testament of "Barral de Baux", in the
2 CONC  presence of “Bertrand de Baux comte d’Avellin”, recording payments “au noble comte de Rodez, veuf de la sœur de Bertrand pour la dot non payée de sa femme...Sibylle mère du comte d’Avellin”[517].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (contract 8 Sep 1256, 15 Dec 1259) HENRI [II] Comte de Rodez, son of HUGUES [IV] Comte de Rodez {Aveyron} and his wife Isabelle de Roquefeuil, Vicomtesse de Creissels {Aveyron} (-Château de Gages 4 Sep 1304, bur Bonval)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://gw.geneanet.org/chatelaine87?lang=en&pz=clara&nz=adobati&p=marquise&n=des+baux Geneanet Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 29 2024, 10:00:13 UTC''
