1 NOTE Styled himself as Emperor of all Hispania.
2 CONT Shaped the Character and civilization of Spain.
2 CONT Had very bad luck with his wives dying on him. Thus he had many of them.
2 CONT His romance with Zaida, baptised, Isabel and the children she bore him is still quite controversial.
2 CONT He never could get along with his Moslem Vassals and as a result they called in the Berbers in an attempt to teach him some civility.
2 CONT Aka: El Batallador.
