2 CONC nt of Comminges, (French); husband of Norberta or Narbona Pérez de Martínez, daughter of Don Pedro Martínez Señor de Subiza, Ricohombre of Navarra; father of Sancho Ramírez de Arellano, IV Lord of Arellano, la Solana and house of 
