2 CONT ES.47161.AGS/3.2,6/Patronato Real, Caja 49,, Doc 82.
2 CONT Translation of document.
2 CONT "Instruccion de Reina Catolica, (Isabel I,) a Ruy Gomez, Para tratar sobre la paz con la Infanta Beatriz de Portugal. Date: 1480"
2 CONT "Instructions from the Queen Catholic, to Ruy Gomez to try to acquire peace between Castilla and Portugal with Princess, Beatriz of Portugal."
