4 CONT From that discussion it only emerged that in full Christmas holidays (25-28) in just 3 days  many of those technical errors were made, to shiver... while diligent users who have brought out huge quantities of documents of very val
4 CONC id OLD & contemporary historians published OFFICIALLY. (You will find them listed in the profile info/about) 
4 CONT I'm not responsible for how ONE keep playing changing that profile name NN alis Junca, or Urraca in the texts of the South American Spaniards {[(probably for some unknown words game) they spanishize any line, exactly as the Anglo-
4 CONC Saxons do it]  or do you think these are the original names of the popes? I updated the multilingual to someone, but I can't do everything myself, all by myself, with only people who don't create anything, & only makes confusion o
4 CONC r cuts without documenting}. 
4 CONT
4 CONT The thing that should make us think that everything traced by this table corresponds with what is already there, much of which was checked personally last year, profile by profile with primary sources site (example MedLands) and w
4 CONC ith the official Italian ecyclopedias (example Treccani) and many others tracks from the Wikipedia notes[.]  
