2 CONT iii)        MARGUERITE .  The Lignages d'Outremer name "Balian, Johan et Marguerite" as the three children of "Julien…sire de Saiete" and his wife "Femie, la fille au roi Heiton d'Ermenie", stating that Marguerite married "Gui le 
2 CONC seignor de Giblet"[1011].  The retrospective dispensation issued by Pope Nicholas IV for the marriage of "Guido de Ibelino, dominus Gibeleti, quondam" and "Margarita quondam" is dated 23 May 1289[1012].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (retrospective Papal dispensation 23 May 1289) GUY Ibelin [Embriaco] Lord of Jebail, son of HENRI Embriaco Lord of Jebail & his wife Isabelle Ibelin (-murdered Nephim Jan 1282). 
