2 CONT *'''Duke of Brunswick and Lunenburg:''' 1252–1269 jointly with John
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Otto/6000000003646057185 Otto I(Otto the Child)] '''Successor:''' Partitioning among the rulers
