1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wrong parentage! See https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b8452248k/f1.item.r=.zoom
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Bianca Giovanna Sforza was repeatedly portrayed by Italian artists.  Bianca's most famous portrait is a picture of 
2 CONT Leonardo da Vinci's La Bella Principessa , showing the princess at the age of thirteen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bianca_Giovanna_Sforza
2 CONT
2 CONT The ultimate proof of authorship by Leonardo was a fragment of a fingerprint found on the portrait.  It turned out that it is identical with the imprint of the middle finger of his left hand Leonard image located on St. Jerome in 
2 CONC the Wilderness . 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portrait_of_a_Young_Fianc%C3%A9e
