2 CONT Pazzi conspiracy: 
2 CONT
2 CONT As the evening wore on, Lorenzo received a visit from his sister Bianca who begged that her husband, Guglielmo de' Pazzi's life be spared. Lorenzo gave Guglielmo and his sister sanctuary in the Medici Palace until the Signoria sen
2 CONC t an order that the Pazzi husband be banished from Florence. This same order expelled Jacopo Bracciolini's two brothers.
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT Per stabilire un legame di parentela che smussasse eventuali conflitti di interessi, nell’agosto 1459 [https://www.geni.com/people/Cosimo-de-Medici-il-Vecchio/6000000001063161411  Cosimo de’ Medici] fece sposare la nipote '''Bianc
2 CONC a (1445-1505, non 1488 come in quasi tutte le fonti)''' con Guglielmo de’ Pazzi (1437-1516).
