2 CONT '''Successor'''	Giulio de' Medici
2 CONT '''Born	12 September 1492'''
2 CONT '''Florence, Republic of Florence'''
2 CONT '''Died	4 May 1519 (aged 26)'''
2 CONT '''Careggi, Republic of Florence'''
2 CONT Noble family	Medici
