1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Biachino II° o Biaquino o Bianchino di Porcia del Colonnello di Sotto, comes de Purziglia
2 CONT
2 CONT Being a son of Guido (died 1416) he cannot be born after 1417.
2 CONT
2 CONT He probably died between 1470 and 1484 because in 1470 his son Prosdocimo in quoted as "Prosdocimo di Bianchino di Porcia", while in in 1484 as "Prosdocimo del fu Bianchino".
2 CONT *http://www.sa-fvg.archivi.beniculturali.it/fileadmin/inventari/archivi_privati/Porcia-Ricchieri._Inventario__G._Cruciatti__ed._2017_.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT ''..so NOT 1472-1536, but not even the "death father date 1416" is referenced-documented:  we can't go on pulling dates like rubber bands, trying one to another unfounded, creating others unfounded :/ 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''& son of Guido from where?
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT Si tratta di Girolamo I (?-1526), figlio di '''Bianchino''' e Donata di Collalto, ...
2 CONT
2 CONT *http://www.sa-fvg.archivi.beniculturali.it/fileadmin/inventari/archivi_privati/Porcia-Ricchieri._Inventario__G._Cruciatti__ed._2017_.pdf
2 CONT
