1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pandulf_Ironhead
2 CONT
2 CONT Pandolfo was the son of Landolfo II, principe di Benevento e Capua, and his wife [Wanzia] [Yvantia] [SIC - disputed] .  He was prince of Benevento and Capua from 943 or 944 until his death. He was made duke of Spoleto and Camerino
2 CONC  in 967 and succeeded as prince of Salerno in 977 or 978. He was an important nobleman in the fight against the Byzantines and Saracens for control of the Mezzogiorno in the centuries after the collapse of Lombard and Carolingian 
2 CONC authority on the Italian peninsula. He had established himself over almost the whole of the southern half of Italy before his death. With his wife Aloara he had five sons of whom Landolfo would have progeny. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Benevento-14
