2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Charles Cawley, Medieval Lands, Sicily/Naples, Counts and Kings
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ www.Kleio.org/en/history/famtree/sforza/1050aa.html, by Maike Vogt-Luerssen
