1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT "Cecily of York, Viscountess Welles (20 March 1469 – 24 August 1507) was an English Princess and the third, but eventual second surviving, daughter of Edward IV, King of England and his queen consort Elizabeth, née Lady Elizabeth 
2 CONC Grey, daughter of Richard Woodville, 1st Earl Rivers and Jacquetta of Luxembourg."
