2 CONC f England, Lord High Treasurer and Jacquetta (Jacqueline) of Luxembourg, circa 27 March 1450; They had 1 daughter (Joan, wife of Sir George Stanley, Lord Strange).2,14,5,6,8,9,10 Sir John Strange, 8th Baron Strange, Lord Mohun mar
2 CONC ried Anne Neville, daughter of Sir Edward Neville, 1st Baron Abergavenny and Katherine Howard, after 1463; No issue.15,16,17,18,2,3,6,7,9 Sir John Strange, 8th Baron Strange, Lord Mohun died on 16 October 1479 at age 35; d.s.p.m. 
2 CONC Buried at Hillingdon, Middlesex.19,2,6,9
