2 CONT *'''John IX Lestrange, 8th Lord Strange (of Knokyn)1
2 CONT *'''M, #1038, b. circa 1444, d. 16 October 1479
2 CONT *Last Edited=13 Dec 2012
2 CONT *''' John IX Lestrange, 8th Lord Strange (of Knokyn) was born circa 1444.1 He was the son of Richard Lestrange.3 He married Jacquetta Woodville, daughter of Richard Wydevill, 1st Earl Rivers and Jacquetta de Luxembourg, on 27 Marc
2 CONC h 1450.4 He married, secondly, Anne Neville, daughter of Sir Edward Neville, 1st Lord Abergavenny and Katherine Howard, before 1479.1 He died on 16 October 1479,[leaving] an only child and heiress, who according to later legal doc
2 CONC trine succeeded in her own right to the Baronies of Strange (of Knokyn) and Mohun: without male issue.4 He died on 16 October 1479.1
2 CONT *'''     He gained the title of 8th Lord Strange, of Knokyn.1 A prominent Yorkist.4
2 CONT *'''Child of John IX Lestrange, 8th Lord Strange (of Knokyn) and Jacquetta Woodville
2 CONT ** 1.Joan Lestrange, Baroness Strange+ b. c 1463, d. 20 Mar 1513/14
2 CONT *Citations
