2 CONT *''''''Joan Lestrange, Baroness Strange1
2 CONT *''''''F, #13853, d. 20 March 1513/14
2 CONT *Last Edited=28 Aug 2008
2 CONT *''''''     Joan Lestrange, Baroness Strange was the daughter of John IX Lestrange, 8th Lord Strange (of Knokyn) and Jacquetta Woodville. She married Sir George Stanley, Lord Strange (of Knokyn), son of Thomas Stanley, 1st Earl of
2 CONC  Derby and Eleanor Neville, before 26 February 1480/81.1 She died on 20 March 1513/14.1
2 CONT *''''''     She succeeded to the title of 9th Baroness Strange in 1479. Her married name became Stanley.
2 CONT *''''''Children of Joan Lestrange, Baroness Strange and Sir George Stanley, Lord Strange (of Knokyn)
2 CONT ** 1.John Stanley2
2 CONT ** 2.Sir James Stanley+2
2 CONT ** 3.Thomas Stanley, 2nd Earl of Derby+1 b. b 1485, d. 23 May 1521
2 CONT *Citations
