1 CONT Paternal great-grandfather:
1 CONT Henry of Grosmont, 1st Duke of Lancaster
1 CONT Paternal great-grandmother:
1 CONT Isabel de Beaumont
1 CONT Mother:
1 CONT Mary de Bohun
1 CONT Maternal grandfather:
1 CONT Humphrey de Bohun, 7th Earl of Hereford
1 CONT Maternal great-grandfather:
1 CONT William de Bohun, 1st Earl of Northampton
1 CONT Maternal great-grandmother:
1 CONT Elizabeth Badlesmere
1 CONT Maternal grandmother:
1 CONT Joan FitzAlan
1 CONT Maternal great-grandfather:
1 CONT Richard FitzAlan, 10th Earl of Arundel
1 CONT Maternal great-grandmother:
1 CONT Eleanor of Lancaster
