1 CONC  Notes: Queen of the Romans. The Complete Peerage vol.IV,p.320-321,note c.  Father: Berenger, Raymond V of Provence, Count of Provence 4th, b. 1198   Mother: de Savoie, Beatrice   Married 23 NOV 1243, Westminster Abbey, London, En
