1 CONT     * J. L. Laynesmith, The Last Medieval Queens: English Queenship 1445-1503, 2004, pp. 199-200 (regarding the anger of King Henry VII at her final marriage and his confiscation of her estates, and the negotiations for a resoluti
1 CONC on and partial restoration of Princess Cecily's property by the King's mother, Margaret, Countess of Richmond and Derby)
