1 CONT The comedy series The Black Adder features an alternative history where Richard succeeded his uncle to the throne as King Richard IV of England (reigned 1485–1498, though Richard has two grown up sons in The Black Adder in 1485, i
1 CONC n reality he would have been twelve years old) before being poisoned and succeeded by King Henry VII.
